Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

We encourage all students to visit the campus of their major. Scheduling a campus visit at https://visit.asu.edu/ will provide you the opportunity to see what life is like as an ASU student.

You can customize your visit experience to include academic sessions, residential hall open houses, or a tour of Barrett, The Honors College.

If you have any questions, let me know and I’ll be happy to help!

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

